    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Heavy-duty combat actuators that replace the standard elbow and shoulder servo assemblies with hydraulic force amplifiers, dramatically increasing the kinetic energy delivered in each close-combat strike. The system is tuned for combat applications rather than general movement, meaning strikes hit with a force well beyond what the wearer's musculature alone could generate. Grants a +2 item bonus to melee damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. </em></p>"
